  "description": "The XROS Mini is an elegantly simple yet satisfying pod kit from Vaporesso, that offers fuss-free, flavoursome vaping with a surprisingly luxurious and durable finish. With its sleek, diamond-patterned, compact form-factor, the XROS mini kit feels lightweight yet solid in the hand and is discreet enough to carry everywhere. Its in-built 1000mAh ensures all-day long vaping, assisted further by super-fast USB-C charging . With no buttons to press or settings to adjust, the XROS Mini’s autodraw mode means you only need to take a puff as you would a traditional cigarette, making it ideal for newer vapers. A coloured LED light on the fascia lets you know how much battery life you have left. The updated XROS MINI pod comes with a fixed 1.2ohm coil preinstalled for a superb MTL (mouth-to-lung) sensation, and employs Vaporesso’s SSS Leak-Resistant Technology and a top filling system to ensure refills are quick and clean. And when your coil’s performance drops, simply replace with a new XROS Mini pod. Simple, stylish and long-lasting, the XROS Mini is as easy to use as it is satisfying and is ideal for use with classic , 50/50 and nic salt e-liquids.",
